<title>HUNGARY: BONBON HEMINGWAY WIDENS H1 LOSSES.</title>
<headline>BONBON HEMINGWAY WIDENS H1 LOSSES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Jan-June 1997     Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating result	  27.7 loss   vs    15.9 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    26.8 loss   vs    15.7 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales		  414.3	  vs   350.8</p>
<p>    Other revenue	     21.0	  vs    19.3</p>
<p>    Material expenditures  309.0	  vs   262.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures  93.4	  vs    75.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation		11.9	  vs    11.9</p>
<p>    Other costs		 40.7	  vs    29.6</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	 8.0	  vs     7.3</p>
<p>    Net financial income     0.4 profit vs     0.2 profit</p>
<p>    Net extraord. expend.    0.4 profit vs     0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Bonbon Hemingway Rt operates confectionary shops.</p>
